flowchart TD
    Employee[Employee Browser/Mobile PWA] --> HTTPS[HTTPS Load Balancer]
    HTTPS --> Frontend[Next.js Progressive Web App]
    
    Frontend --> API[Spring Boot API Gateway]
    
    Frontend --> OfflineSync[Offline Sync Service Worker]
    OfflineSync --> LocalDB[(Local SQLite/IndexedDB)]
    LocalDB --> BackgroundSync[Background Sync API]
    BackgroundSync --> API
    
    API --> Auth[Auth Service]
    API --> Attendance[Attendance Service]
    API --> Shift[Shift Service]
    API --> Leave[Leave Service]
    API --> EmployeeService[Employee Service]
    
    Auth --> Redis[(Redis Session Cache)]
    Auth --> EntraID[Microsoft Entra ID]
    
    Attendance --> PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL Attendance DB)]
    Attendance --> AzureFace[Azure Face API]
    Attendance --> S3[Encrypted S3 Storage]
    
    Shift --> PostgreSQL
    Leave --> PostgreSQL
    EmployeeService --> PostgreSQL
    
    PostgreSQL --> Cron[Cron Job Processor]
    Cron --> Batch[Monthly Batch Processor]
    Batch --> Export[Payroll Export CSV/S3]
    
    EmployeeService --> EntraIDSync[Entra ID Sync Service]
    EntraIDSync --> EntraID
    
    Attendance --> Notify[SendGrid Email Service]
    Leave --> Notify
    
    AzureFace --> S3
    S3 --> Delete[Auto-delete Temp Images]
    
    Manager[Manager Interface] --> Frontend
    HR[HR Admin Interface] --> Frontend
    Payroll[Payroll Export Interface] --> Frontend
    
    PolicyEngine[Policy Engine with Versioning] --> PostgreSQL
    TimezoneEngine[Timezone-aware Calculation Engine] --> PostgreSQL
    
    Autoscaler[Regional Pod Autoscaler] --> EKS[EKS Cluster]
    EKS --> Frontend
    EKS --> API